  "decisions": [
    "Canonical absolute kcal/gram nullable snapshot preserves unknowns and real zeros across parser/review/typed route/Quick Add/Room columns; explicit alternate kJ/kg units convert once.",
    "No schema migration or historical rewrite. Existing 43 nullable Room nutrient columns reused; servings and weight stay metadata only.",
    "Scan initialization disables implicit energy recalculation; direct manual defaults and deliberate calculation remain available. Quick Add rejects non-finite numeric input.",
    "Both promotion seeds/routes preserve the snapshot; runtime destination editor preservation is FOODUS-006 acceptance and remains unclaimed here.",
    "Synthetic generated JPEG, private Koin, real in-memory Room; no owner diary/settings writes, live AI, camera, credentials or private photos.",
    "Accessibility fixture repaired for fresh host windows, safe gestures, hint labels and readback insets. Device rotation policy restored after test.",
    "Legacy catalog retained under release transition; no release authorized."
  ],
